\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Standardised evaluation (seed 0, $T{=}1000$). (a) Distance: a $\sim $150-step power ramp then a plateau with a wide band (bimodal). (b,c) The shoulder error falls but the \emph  {elbow} error stays high. (d) The final-distance heatmap is sharply \emph  {directional}: a reachable upper/right region ($\le 12$\,cm) and a red lower/far-left shortfall ($53$--$103$\,cm). (e) Example reach. (f) Effort is flat across radius --- the failing targets spend effort without converging.}}{8}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:eval}{{6}{8}{Standardised evaluation (seed 0, $T{=}1000$). (a) Distance: a $\sim $150-step power ramp then a plateau with a wide band (bimodal). (b,c) The shoulder error falls but the \emph {elbow} error stays high. (d) The final-distance heatmap is sharply \emph {directional}: a reachable upper/right region ($\le 12$\,cm) and a red lower/far-left shortfall ($53$--$103$\,cm). (e) Example reach. (f) Effort is flat across radius --- the failing targets spend effort without converging}{figure.caption.6}{}}
